{"event":"changes_requested","job_id":"api-explorer-payment-latest-post-technicalcancel","reason":"Independently read all 203 numbered endpoint raw lines; the trusted SHA-256, five quotes/locators, candidate/receipt and suggestions match. One material omission remains. For the query 'Can I use /technicalCancel days later with a reused merchant reference because I lack the original PSP reference?', the candidate's unrestricted opening can suggest yes. The endpoint raw does not state the limits, but its linked Classic cancellation guide explicitly restricts technical cancel to 24 hours after authorization and unique payment references (guide raw lines 138-145). That guide also scopes cancellation to uncaptured authorization, distinguishes captured/uncertain states (lines 17, 35-39), identifies the response PSP reference as the modification's (161-164), and documents later TECHNICAL_CANCEL webhook success/failure (172-178). The current source and fixed answers leave those consequential qualifications undiscoverable at the route and say no later outcome mechanism is specified without directing readers to the guide."}
